  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": ", & Drihten fiht for eow. \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: Sege Israhela folce \u00fe\u00e6t hi faran to \u00f0\u00e6re Readan S\u00e6. & a\u00f0ene \u00f0ine gyrde ofer \u00f0a s\u00e6 & tod\u00e6l hi, \u00f0\u00e6t Israhela folc ga drium fotum innan \u00f0a s\u00e6. & ic ahyrde Pharaones heortan & his folces, \u00f0\u00e6t hi fara\u00f0 \u00e6fter eow innan \u00f0a s\u00e6, \u00fe\u00e6t ic beo \u00d0a Moyses a\u00f0enode his hand ofer \u00f0a s\u00e6: \u00f0a sende Drihten micelne wind ealle \u00f0a niht & gewende \u00f0a & \u00f0\u00e6t w\u00e6ter stod on twa healfa \u00f0\u00e6re str\u00e6te swylce twegen heage weallas; \u00f0a for eall Ysrahela folc \u00d0a Pharao com to \u00f0\u00e6re s\u00e6, & eal his here, \u00f0a for he on \u00feone ylcan weg \u00e6fter Israhela folce on \u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: A\u00f0ene \u00f0ine hand ofer \u00f0a s\u00e6 & ofer Faraon & ofer ealne his here. & he ahefde up his hand, & seo s\u00e6 sloh tog\u00e6dere & ahwylfde Pharaones cratu, & adrencte hine So\u00f0lice Moyses & Israhela folc foron \u00f0urh \u00f0a s\u00e6 drium fotum. & Drihten alysde on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge Israhela folc of \u00f0\u00e6ra Egyptiscra handum. & hi gesawon \u00fea Egyptiscan deade up to lande aworpene, \u00fee heora \u00e6r ehton on \u00f0am lande \u00fee hi \u00f0a \u00deA Moyses h\u00e6fde gefaren ofer \u00f0a Readan S\u00e6, \u00fea gegaderode he eal Israhela folc tog\u00e6dere & sang Maria w\u00e6s gehaten Moy",
